---
const title = 'Diego Martin — Software Engineering Lead';
const description =
  'Software engineering leader based in Málaga, Spain, with more than 20 years of experience building software systems.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f3ee" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --ink: #17211f;
        --muted: #64716c;
        --line: #d9ded8;
        --green: #216454;
        --paper: #f5f3ee;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
      }
      .page {
        width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 48px));
        margin: auto;
      }
      .topline {
        padding: 28px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        font:
          12px 'DM Mono',
          monospace;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .topline a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .hero {
        padding: 88px 0 76px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 250px;
        gap: 50px;
        align-items: end;
      }
      .eyebrow,
      .label {
        color: var(--green);
        font:
          12px 'DM Mono',
          monospace;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      h1 {
        max-width: 780px;
        margin: 18px 0 20px;
        font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 92px);
        letter-spacing: -0.075em;
        line-height: 0.98;
      }
      .intro {
        max-width: 660px;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #495650;
      }
      .card {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 22px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      }
      .card p {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .card strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 17px;
      }
      .action {
        display: inline-flex;
        margin-top: 12px;
        padding: 13px 17px;
        background: var(--green);
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .content {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
        padding: 42px 0;
      }
      h2 {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-size: 22px;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }
      .content p {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 700px;
        color: #495650;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
      .tags {
        margin-top: 22px;
        display: flex;
        gap: 9px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .tags span {
        padding: 9px 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: #43534c;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 24px 0 40px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      @media (max-width: 680px) {
        .page {
          width: min(100% - 36px, 1100px);
        }
        .hero {
          padding: 58px 0;
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 30px;
        }
        .content {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 16px;
        }
        .topline {
          padding: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
          gap: 12px;
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
      @media print {
        body {
          background: white;
        }
        .page {
          width: 100%;
        }
        .action {
          display: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <header class="topline">
        <a href="https://coderiff.net">CodeRiff</a><span>Curriculum vitae · Málaga, Spain</span>
      </header>
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Software engineering · Technical leadership</p>
          <h1>Diego<br />Martin<span style="color:var(--green)">.</span></h1>
          <p class="intro">
            Software engineering leader with more than 20 years of hands-on experience designing, building and evolving
            software systems. I work across architecture and delivery, helping teams solve the right problem and build
            software that can keep changing with the business.
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside class="card">
          <p>Based in</p><strong>Málaga, Spain</strong>
          <p style="margin-top:20px">Working style</p><strong>Remote · Worldwide</strong>
          <a class="action" href="https://coderiff.net/#contact">Get in touch ↗</a>
        </aside>
      </section>
      <section class="content">
        <p class="label">01 / Profile</p>
        <div>
          <h2>Experience grounded in delivery.</h2><p>
            My work spans software engineering, architecture and technical consulting, with a focus on the .NET
            ecosystem and information systems. I bring practical experience to complex systems: understanding the
            domain, making sound design choices, and supporting teams as they deliver and evolve software.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="content">
        <p class="label">02 / Focus</p>
        <div>
          <h2>Architecture that serves the problem.</h2><p>
            Designing systems that are understandable, resilient and able to evolve. I use architectural patterns when
            they help address real constraints and business needs.
          </p><div class="tags">
            <span>.NET & C#</span><span>Software architecture</span><span>Event Sourcing</span><span>CQRS</span><span
              >Event-driven systems</span
            ><span>Technical leadership</span><span>System integration</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="content">
        <p class="label">03 / Approach</p>
        <div>
          <h2>Understand first. Build with intent.</h2><p>
            Good engineering starts with understanding the problem. The goal is software that solves the right problem,
            makes sense to the people working with it, and can continue evolving for years to come.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <footer class="footer">
        <span>Diego Martin · Software Engineering Lead</span><a href="https://coderiff.net/#contact"
          >Contact via CodeRiff ↗</a
        >
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
